// movsw`) out of the member at 0x38 and the other two copy four out of
// 0x48 and 0x58 - exactly queue/result/visited_points at their proven
// element sizes - and the body then walks valid_left..valid_right
// (0x28/0x30) with a type_point whose z field it drives from the second
// and third parameters.
//
